[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_03_0010","text":"啊……刚才听到了吗？\n猫头鹰的叫声……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_03_0020","text":"诶……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_03_0030","text":"啊……\n听到了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_03_0040","text":"明天就要回事务所了啊……\n感觉像一趟小旅行，挺开心的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_03_0050","text":"不过，这种心态可不行啊……！\n凛世可是认真完成了拍摄的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_03_0060","text":"不……不会……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_03_0070","text":"凛世也……\n是这么……想的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_03_0080","text":"……真的吗？\n哈哈，那就太好了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_03_0090","text":"啊……流星……！\n……看到了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_03_0100","text":"诶……\n啊……"}]
